msgid "A catalog file (wplc-catalog.json) describes one license product: its product key, the prefix of its entitlement keys, and every entitlement with its labels. The add-on of the product ships the file. The product editor offers the entitlements listed here as tick boxes; planned products and planned entitlements are not offered."
